run08.text:
The robot has been instructed to navigate to the dining room and open it, which effectively opens and holds the door for the person.

```json
{
  "root": {
    "type": "sequence",
    "memory": true,
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "action",
        "name": "navigate_to_dining",
        "action": "navigate",
        "params": {
          "target_location": "dining"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "action",
        "name": "open_dining_door",
        "action": "open",
        "params": {
          "target_location": "dining"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
